  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="navbar" id="navbar">
      <div class="navbar-left">
        <ul class="nav-list">
            <li><a href="/">home</a></li>
          <p>|</p>
          <li><a href="/rules">rules</a></li>
          <p>|</p>
          <li><a href="/faq">faq</a></li>
          <p>|</p>
          <li><a href="/quirks">quirks</a></li>
          <p>|</p>
          <li><a href="/moshpits">moshpits</a></li>
          <p>|</p>
          <li><a href="/othersites">other sites</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="navbar-middle">
        <div class="title" onclick="window.location.href='/'">
          <h2>[ moshr.net ]</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="navbar-right">
         
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="navbar" id="navbar2">
      <div class="navbar-left">
        <select name="pages" id="pages" onchange="
    if (this.value.startsWith('/')) {
      window.location = this.value
    }
  ">
         
            <option value="" selected disabled hidden>pages</option>
            <option value="/">home</option>
            <option value="/rules">rules</option>
            <option value="/faq">faq</option>
            <option value="/quirks">quirks</option>
            <option value="/popular">popular</option>
            <option value="/trending">trending</option>
            <option value="/recent">recent</option>
            <option value="/othersites">other sites</option>
          
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="navbar-middle">
        <div class="title">
          <h2 onclick="window.location.href='/moshpit/'">
            [  moshr.net ]
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="navbar-right">
        
      </div>
    </div>
   <% if (settings.announcement_status) {  %>
    <div class="announcement">
      <p id="announcement-text"><%- settings.announcement %></p>
    </div> <% } %>

    <div class="body">
      <div class="body-right1">
        <div class="moshpit-info">
          <div class="tab-nav-div">
            <ul class="tab-nav">
              <li><B>recently created</B></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <ul class="info-list">
              <% recent.forEach(moshpit => { if (!moshpit.hid) { %>
              <li><a href="/<%= moshpit.title %>/">/<%= moshpit.title %>/ - <%= moshpit.post_count + moshpit.thread_count%> <%= moshpit.post_count+ moshpit.thread_count === 1 ? 'post' : 'posts' %></a></li>
              <% }}) %>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="body-left">
        <!-- <h3 style="margin-left: 7px;margin-top: 2px;color: #d2d6dc">faq</h3> -->
        <div class="misc-text">
        <h3>what is moshr?</h3> 
        moshr is an anonymous text-only forum. you do not need an account to post here.  
        <h3>how do i post?</h3> 
        to make a new thread simply click on the "create new thread" button in the top right corner.  to post in a thread simply click the "reply" button at the top or bottom of the thread or click reply on someones post.  
        <h3>what is a moshpit?</h3> 
        a moshpit is a sub-forum dedicated to a specific topic 
        <h3>how do i make a moshpit?</h3> 
        simply type whatever you want the moshpit name (needs to be 7 characters or under) to be while making a new thread.
        moshpits are based on user activity. all you need is one thread for a moshpit to become active.
        a thread gets scheduled for deletion after 7 days of existence 
        <h3>what is a quirk?</h3> 
        a typing quirk. basically something that modifies text to make it more exciting
<h3>what does it mean when it says someone was shot or slapped?</h3> 
        the OP of a thread is the defacto moderator of that thread. slapping mutes someone from the thread for one hour while shooting mutes them permanently 
         <h3>why isnt there a list of rules per moshpit?</h3> 
        this site is a bit of an experiment. by not having rules communities will determine and enforce what they find socially acceptable on their own
        <h3>where can i find ascii/shift-jis art?</h3> 
        <a href="https://aahub.org/" target="_blank"><u>https://aahub.org/</u></a> and <a href="https://aa.mozz.us/utf8art/scroller.shtml" target="_blank"><u>https://aa.mozz.us/utf8art/scroller.shtml</u></a>  
        <h3>how do i link to another moshpit?</h3> 
        #moshpit_name   
        <h3>how can i support the site?</h3> 
        by being active, by sharing the site with friends, or by donating monero to the address below. <br>
        4392zNHicMVNs49Md7sHpWeFpj3UhZiyThXTH6EHMxYU9FPxRRfVJpWTGo2f1UjQCDU8HDqXuZjk34QQGAHKaohK7uEF5T6   
        
        
        </div>
       
      </div>
     <div class="body-right">
        <div class="moshpit-info">
          <div class="tab-nav-div">
            <ul class="tab-nav">
              <li><B>trending</B></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <ul class="info-list">
              <% trending.forEach(moshpit => { if (!moshpit.hid) { %>
              <li><a href="/<%= moshpit.title %>/">/<%= moshpit.title %>/ - <%= moshpit.recent_count %> <%= moshpit.recent_count === 1 ? 'post in the last hour' : 'posts in the last hour' %></a></li>
              <% }}) %>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    

   
  </body>
</html>
